From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 07:57:47 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/vaddr: pass scheme to damos_va_invalid_folio()

Fix the build failure.

Fixes: 046c68e46b04 ("mm/damon/vaddr: use damos->last_applied for migrate action")
Reported-by: kernel test robot <lkp@intel.com>
Closes: https://lore.kernel.org/oe-kbuild-all/202611010354.GdEQgO22-lkp@intel.com/
Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/vaddr.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mm/damon/vaddr.c b/mm/damon/vaddr.c
index d82f5afa84a2c..c699f2a11b8cc 100644
--- a/mm/damon/vaddr.c
+++ b/mm/damon/vaddr.c
@@ -891,7 +891,7 @@ static int damos_va_migrate_pmd_entry(pmd_t *pmd, unsigned long addr,
 		if (pte_none(ptent) || !pte_present(ptent))
 			continue;
 		folio = vm_normal_folio(walk->vma, addr, ptent);
-		if (damos_va_invalid_folio(folio))
+		if (damos_va_invalid_folio(folio, s))
 			continue;
 		page_idx = folio_page_idx(folio, pte_page(ptent));
 		nr = folio_nr_pages(folio) - page_idx;
-- 
2.47.3

